Description: Python bindings for FFmpeg
 Python bindings for FFmpeg, with support for complex filter graphs.
 SciNova's fork of kkroening/ffmpeg-python with the future/past.builtins
 Python 2 compatibility shims removed, since only Python 3 is
 supported here.
